# Paths exempt from the check-shell-complexity action, one per line, relative to the repository root, each with a
# `# reason` on the same line. Repo-owned: sync never touches this file. An entry whose file has no refused construct
# left fails the check as stale. "owed" names a block whose TypeScript replacement is not written yet.
actions/bun-setup/action.yml # the pre-bun pin walk: bash is all there is before bun exists
.github/workflows/reusable-site.yml # owed: the Pages probe and the link-rot verdict run in the caller's checkout, so a composite action is their shape
actions/semgrep/action.yml # owed: a judge script beside the scan step, run by the action's own bun
actions/validate-managed-files/action.yml # owed: the no-bun fallback of the report step
